`.jgatefail.txt` reported: `MERGE CONFLICT with latest manus-parity: run git merge
manus-parity, resolve all conflicts keeping both sides, commit.`

### Root cause
The only conflicted file was the tracked rollup marker `.jdone`. Both sides prepended a
new report at the same top-of-file anchor (O1 on this branch; V11, then D15, then H1 on
manus-parity), so git could not auto-merge the two additions. No source file conflicted
and no source file needed editing: the O1 deliverables (`src/protocol/eventLog.ts` +
`src/protocol/__tests__/eventLog.test.ts`, commit `83b6b8a`) were already committed and
present.

