  `resolveEditOperations`; constants `MAX_BATCH_EDITS` (50),
  `EDIT_CONTEXT_LINES` (3); rewritten `file_edit` schema + `run()`.
- `src/tools/__tests__/editHints.test.ts` - new, 23 tests.
