  old wording to the ported messages (`/found 2 times/`, `/Provide more context/`,
  `/old_string not found in/`, `/file_read/`); nothing weakened.
- `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES` - added the `src/tools/files.ts` adaptation entry.

